thinking
**Fixing non-ASCII title in Bedford file**

Noticed the patch inserted a weird diacritic (\u02dd) in "Deficit" causing non-ASCII issues; planning to revert it to standard ASCII "Deficit" in the Bedford file's Title and details using a small patch.
